HCJ0BKA0",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["太陽蕃茄拉麵從進來台灣，我一直是支持者。最近菜單有更動，多了肉醬系列，立刻嘗鮮。\n我點的是茄子肉醬拉麵，新的點餐App比之前好用，不僅選寬麵細麵這些，連要加湯（100cc 20元）或用菜代替麵等，都可以完成，其實也增加廚房準備餐點的明確度。\n朋友點的是蕃茄肉醬滑蛋起司拉麵，我這位歐洲朋友是不知客套為何物的，不好吃的東西他就說不好吃，但他很喜歡這裡的拉麵，我覺得很接近他們的 comfort food 。\n配餐方面，飲料還是有點水水的；炸雞或可樂餅是現做，有時候比較鹹，但熱熱脆脆的，就不太會失望，但重點還是熱湯麵，好吃！",null,[0,200]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11841181031689736861/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVLVkZWcVl6RmlNMFp3VWxWMGNHUnFVbmhrYXpGTlZFZG9kR0ZXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11841181031689736861/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVLVkZWcVl6RmlNMFp3VWxWMGNHUnFVbmhrYXpGTlZFZG9kR0ZXUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11841181031689736861/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVLVkZWcVl6RmlNMFp3VWxWMGNHUnFVbmhrYXpGTlZFZG9kR0ZXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11841181031689736861/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVLVkZWcVl6RmlNMFp3VWxWMGNHUnFVbmhrYXpGTlZFZG9kR0ZXUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11841181031689736861/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVLVkZWcVl6RmlNMFp3VWxWMGNHUnFVbmhrYXpGTlZFZG9kR0ZXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11841181031689736861/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVLVkZWcVl6RmlNMFp3VWxWMGNHUnFVbmhrYXpGTlZFZG9kR0ZXUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,747,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KVFVqYzFiM0ZwUlV0cGRqUnhkazFNVEdodGFWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x3c8adf9705084174!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnJTUjc1b3FpRUtpdjRxdk1MTGhtaVE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KVFVqYzFiM0ZwUlV0cGRqUnhkazFNVEdodGFWRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodH